@@ -235,7 +235,8 @@ Functions
 .. function:: setERPContact(erp2)
 
    Sets the Error Reduction Parameter for contacts: how fast overlapping objects are pushed apart.
-   Only with Bullet NEXT.
+   After an impact the push adds no speed (split impulse), so objects bounce at their
+   restitution. Only with Bullet NEXT.
 
    :arg erp2: The contact ERP, 0.0 to 1.0 (default 0.8, as in Blender 2.79b).
    :type erp2: float
